 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I waited long for the Lord to hear",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My cry went up through the heavy air",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He bent down low to look at me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And answered what I was calling free",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He lifted me up out of the pit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the clay where I was stuck in it",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He set my feet upon a solid rock",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And made my steps secure and strong",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The mud held fast but he pulled me out",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My fear was broken, my doubt removed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A new song rose within my mouth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To praise the God who made me found",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He lifted me up out of the pit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the clay where I was stuck in it",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He set my feet upon a solid rock",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And made my steps secure and strong",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Many will see and stand in awe",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And put their trust in what he gave",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed is the one who trusts the Lord",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who turns away from the proud and bored",
